/* THE BAROVIAN PROP PACKS — ChatGPT's original low-poly models (PRs #63–#67 and #69; generated by the scripts in
   the scripts/build-barovian scripts, no outside meshes or textures), in the barovian folders of public/assets/props. Each becomes a
   prop kind in the Build tab's palette (src/data/props.js reads this), with its model (src/data/prop-models.js reads
   this too) and how minis meet it.

   For each:
   - n: its name in the palette; cat: its palette group; w × h: the squares it covers (x × y, before turning)
   - file: the model, under public/assets/props/
   - draw: the code-drawn prop it falls back to (the offline file, or a model that can't load)
   - move: 'walk' (walk over it), 'hop' (hop over: difficult), 'top' (climb onto it, standing at top), 'block' (go round)
   - ht: how tall it stands, in squares (the model is scaled to its squares, no taller than this)
   - alt: the other state of the same thing (a gate shut and raised, a mirror still and reaching): the DM's prop card
     changes one into the other in place */
